The application does not require any external service to run. The D3 network
visualisation loads static/d3.v7.min.js locally; you should download the
minified D3 v7 file from https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js and place it in
static/ before first use of the Network page.

Deploying
Put the app behind an HTTPS reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy). The app itself
serves plain HTTP; do not expose it directly to the internet.
